    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soggy Beans is a relaxing side-idler where fish visit you. Think bird watching, but with fish. Decorate, take pictures, complete photography quests, or just let your friends keep you company while you do other things.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2636430/extras/32e34943af4b3b4d03a09b0636ea1391.poster.avif?t=1749340806\" width=600 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2636430/extras/32e34943af4b3b4d03a09b0636ea1391.webm?t=1749340806\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2636430/extras/32e34943af4b3b4d03a09b0636ea1391.mp4?t=1749340806\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Soggy Beans was made from a desire to have a low intensity game to enjoy on the side of other things, instead of watching videos or scrolling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play as much or as little as you like</strong>: let it run while you check your emails, during meetings, or even while playing other games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2636430/extras/61bca2a0a3ebce410d130561a8717d2b.poster.avif?t=1749340806\" width=600 height=40 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2636430/extras/61bca2a0a3ebce410d130561a8717d2b.webm?t=1749340806\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2636430/extras/61bca2a0a3ebce410d130561a8717d2b.mp4?t=1749340806\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2636430/extras/7739a69814014757091753c4ebe2c7e2.poster.avif?t=1749340806\" width=600 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2636430/extras/7739a69814014757091753c4ebe2c7e2.webm?t=1749340806\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2636430/extras/7739a69814014757091753c4ebe2c7e2.mp4?t=1749340806\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Find fish of all shapes and sizes.</strong> Fish come and go as they please, spot new ones as they visit and record each sighting in your journal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2636430/extras/ce6df2440eb913c08521c02d2ab7c755.poster.avif?t=1749340806\" width=600 height=40 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2636430/extras/ce6df2440eb913c08521c02d2ab7c755.webm?t=1749340806\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2636430/extras/ce6df2440eb913c08521c02d2ab7c755.mp4?t=1749340806\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2636430/extras/b02c2bc82275567bcee031f3b337133e.poster.avif?t=1749340806\" width=600 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2636430/extras/b02c2bc82275567bcee031f3b337133e.webm?t=1749340806\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2636430/extras/b02c2bc82275567bcee031f3b337133e.mp4?t=1749340806\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Keep track of all the fish</strong> you see, update their profiles, and watch as your journal grows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2636430/extras/33dcf95c46bb5357534fb75b7db7f186.poster.avif?t=1749340806\" width=600 height=40 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2636430/extras/33dcf95c46bb5357534fb75b7db7f186.webm?t=1749340806\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2636430/extras/33dcf95c46bb5357534fb75b7db7f186.mp4?t=1749340806\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2636430/extras/3f9e73ab17189291d3f6c11b747f1c37.poster.avif?t=1749340806\" width=600 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2636430/extras/3f9e73ab17189291d3f6c11b747f1c37.webm?t=1749340806\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2636430/extras/3f9e73ab17189291d3f6c11b747f1c37.mp4?t=1749340806\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Capture photos of fish</strong> to save the memory forever. Set them as profile pictures in your journal, or use them as stickers in your scrapbook.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2636430/extras/e38e61b5017c1920762783279d7aa3e6.poster.avif?t=1749340806\" width=600 height=40 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2636430/extras/e38e61b5017c1920762783279d7aa3e6.webm?t=1749340806\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2636430/extras/e38e61b5017c1920762783279d7aa3e6.mp4?t=1749340806\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2636430/extras/0c7b2659bcfc377a9c8cf6eb42b497a0.poster.avif?t=1749340806\" width=600 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2636430/extras/0c7b2659bcfc377a9c8cf6eb42b497a0.webm?t=1749340806\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2636430/extras/0c7b2659bcfc377a9c8cf6eb42b497a0.mp4?t=1749340806\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect beans</strong> that fish knock loose. Watch them push the bean machine - sometimes they drop them, sometimes they don\u2019t (but mostly they do!).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2636430/extras/a56c2af6f433966b4efa68486255ab92.poster.avif?t=1749340806\" width=600 height=40 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2636430/extras/a56c2af6f433966b4efa68486255ab92.webm?t=1749340806\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2636430/extras/a56c2af6f433966b4efa68486255ab92.mp4?t=1749340806\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2636430/extras/96c95c75c84a0683fcb5f67df6d46745.poster.avif?t=1749340806\" width=600 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2636430/extras/96c95c75c84a0683fcb5f67df6d46745.webm?t=1749340806\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2636430/extras/96c95c75c84a0683fcb5f67df6d46745.mp4?t=1749340806\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Create your own little corner of the ocean</strong> with a variety of furniture pieces. You can stack things, create blueprints, and change backgrounds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2636430/extras/f26c8a3fbc83151f4f901c294ea22a05.avif?t=1749340806\" width=600 height=69 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Each piece of furniture adds its own touch</strong>, shaping the mood of your seascape and helping attract certain fish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2636430/extras/f8b9e76937c42951ab837fca586f0c12.poster.avif?t=1749340806\" width=600 height=50 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2636430/extras/f8b9e76937c42951ab837fca586f0c12.webm?t=1749340806\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2636430/extras/f8b9e76937c42951ab837fca586f0c12.mp4?t=1749340806\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2636430/extras/bf9b37492d5773a32ee2a7bd98a8829f.avif?t=1749340806\" data-has-big width=800 height=456 /></span></p>",
